{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 102, "line_no": 32, "text": "天地、万物起源的探索和思考中。《古歌•开天辟地》是这样提出问题的，如说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2024, "w": 1379, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "天地、万物起源的探索和思考中。《古歌•开天辟地》是这样提出问题的，如说：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2024, "w": 1379, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 102, "line_no": 33, "text": "天上天连地，土地会顶天。天不言语，地不讲话。天空弯如一把伞，地边靠", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2088, "w": 1295, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "天上天连地，土地会顶天。天不言语，地不讲话。天空弯如一把伞，地边靠", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2088, "w": 1295, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 102, "line_no": 34, "text": "着坡顶尖，有时叫人害怕，有时叫人喜欢。是谁造天这般高？是谁造天这般乱？", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2152, "w": 1383, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "着坡顶尖，有时叫人害怕，有时叫人喜欢。是谁造天这般高？是谁造天这般乱？", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2152, "w": 1383, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 102, "line_no": 35, "text": "造它盖过地方人，造它坐得这么久。月亮照山川，太阳暖人间。又是谁造水由", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2217, "w": 1379, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "造它盖过地方人，造它坐得这么久。月亮照山川，太阳暖人间。又是谁造水由", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2217, "w": 1379, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 102, "line_no": 36, "text": "天淌？又是谁造成五色天？①”", "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 2277, "w": 528, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "天淌？又是谁造成五色天？①”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 2277, "w": 528, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
